#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Turn the Docker apps in apps.yaml on and off, from the terminal or a phone-friendly web panel.

  dock status                 show every app
  dock urls                   every web page, with its phone and PC link
  dock on      <app|all>      start (creates the app first if its containers don't exist)
  dock off     <app|all>      stop (containers and data are kept)
  dock restart <app|all>      restart
  dock updates                ask each image's registry whether a newer image is out
  dock update  <app|all>      pull newer images and recreate the containers (data is kept)
  dock logs    <container> [lines]
  dock open    <program>      open a desktop program from `programs:` (Chrome, LocalSend, ...) on this PC's screen
  dock close   <program>      ask that program to quit
  dock later   <program>      push its auto-close back an hour (programs with `close_after_hours`)
                              (programs with `close_when_idle_minutes` close once the PC's keyboard and mouse sit untouched that long)
  dock programs               list the desktop programs and whether each is open
  dock panel                  serve the phone panel on 127.0.0.1:<panel.port>
  dock password               set the ONE phone password shared by the panel, Money and VoiceStudio, 6+ numbers (also the way back in; turns Face ID off)

The panel locks phone visits (those through `tailscale serve`) behind the password or Face ID; this PC
needs no unlock. lock.py and lock.js are copies of the Money app's (finance_tracker/finance/), kept identical.
"""
